      "content": "hey can u help me draft a quick summary for my company's board of directors? they're looking at whether we should start formally integrating ESG metrics into our quarterly reporting or if we should just stick to traditional financial performance metrics. i need a brief overview of why this matters for a company like ours in the current landscape.",
